#X text 20 365 1 ALBUM: name the record \, pick the SIDE (A-D). tracks go to ~/Music/Recordings/vinyl/ALBUM/ as A-01.wav \, A-02.wav... one file per song. 2 needle in the lead-in groove: drag threshold just right of the level bar (the black tick). 3 lift the needle \, ARM \, drop it. REDO throws away the take being recorded \, SPLIT ends this song and starts the next one now (no gap on the record). 4 it stops by itself (DONE) 30 s after the last track. CLIP = too loud \, lower the gain. NO-SIGNAL = nothing coming in., f 72;
#N canvas 120 100 1460 900 logic 0;
#X obj 20 20 adc~ 15 16;
#X text 140 20 input: BlackHole 16ch channels 15 + 16 (Pulsar Bus routes the turntable there). start Pd with BlackHole 16ch as input \, 16 channels. a take starts only after 0.4 s above the threshold (needle drops and clicks are shorter) \, with 600 ms pre-roll so the first beat is kept., f 40;
