#X text 20 920 AUTO: every 100 ms while armed \, a level of 25 or more (real signal \, not needle-up silence) updates the noise floor. between tracks it follows the noise down at once and up gently. during a track it can only go down \, so a loud song never raises the threshold and splits itself. ARM \, AUTO on and a new album start it again from 70., f 60;
